# The fetched corpus payloads are PINNED, NOT COMMITTED — QUESTIONS.md Q-010, ruled.
#
# corpora/MANIFEST.md carries every source, its exact SHA, the fetch commands and the
# verification. corpora/seed_index.json carries OUR selection record and the SHA-256 of
# each pinned file, so a fetched tree is checked against a hash this repository holds.
